Consider the DAG of subcircuits $\mathcal C_{\operatorname{ext}}\ensuremath{\stackrel{\mbox{\upshape\tiny def.}}{=}}(V,E,(g_v)_{v\in V})$, with input block $v_0$ carrying $x$ and designated output $v_{5,1}$, where
